We lock down the scale for security reasons.  The below steps will install software that disables some of this security.

Take the attached file and place it on a USB thumb drive, plug it into the scale.
On the scale, press the triangle button on the left hand side of the screen and select Supervisor Pages > ALL FUNCTIONS > Upgrade via USB
Press the “choose upgrade” button and browse to the file and select it
Press the “Upgrade firmware” button
Screen should say firmware installed or some such message
Reboot the scale via the physical button on the left hand side of the scale near the Ethernet port

When scale comes back up…
On the scale, press the triangle button on the left hand side of the screen and select Service Pages > Setup Utility
Go to the “Network” tab
Setup network as per your requirements then press “Save/Connect”, usually this is simply clicking “DHCP” and “Automatic DNS” radio buttons
